{"unit_id":"lwklbb__DSH-SessionGraph#card-zh","repo":"lwklbb/DSH-SessionGraph","commit":"cd1f0705be4a5b624374f84339e168905c4f1878","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SessionGraph（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把当前会话整理成可编辑的结构化导图。它通过会话输入区的 dock 按钮读取当前会话快照，在浏览器中提取目标、结论、要点、决策、待办和文件产出，并过滤部分调试噪声。主要功能有默认、精简和详细三种整理模式，手动编辑导图节点，以及导出 Markdown、Mermaid、PlantUML、XMind 缩进文本和待办简介。适合需要复盘长会话、整理交接内容或提取后续任务的 DSH Web 用户。使用无需额外配置或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:447-550","lib/extractor.js:41-112"]}
{"unit_id":"lwklbb__DSH-SessionGraph#card-en","repo":"lwklbb/DSH-SessionGraph","commit":"cd1f0705be4a5b624374f84339e168905c4f1878","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH SessionGraph turns a DSH Web chat into an editable mind map. Choose default, concise, or detailed summaries of conclusions and TODOs, edit nodes, then copy as Markdown, Mermaid, PlantUML, XMind, or a TODO brief. Useful for reviewing long chats and handoffs; no extra setup needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:447-550","lib/extractor.js:41-112"]}
