{"unit_id":"lwklbb__DSH-SessionGraph#feature-1","repo":"lwklbb/DSH-SessionGraph","commit":"cd1f0705be4a5b624374f84339e168905c4f1878","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SessionGraph 的功能「会话摘要」：从当前会话消息中整理目标、结论、关键点、决策、待办和文件路径。打开输入区上方的按钮即可生成默认导图，也可选择精简模式只保留结论和待办，或用详细模式加入压缩时间线。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/extractor.js:60-100","lib/client.js:456-470"]}
{"unit_id":"lwklbb__DSH-SessionGraph#feature-2","repo":"lwklbb/DSH-SessionGraph","commit":"cd1f0705be4a5b624374f84339e168905c4f1878","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SessionGraph 的功能「导图编辑」：在结果弹窗中直接重命名节点、添加子节点或删除节点，调整完成后预览对应导出文本。适合在复制前修正自动整理出的标题和层级。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:430-443","lib/client.js:472-477","lib/client.js:524-533"]}
{"unit_id":"lwklbb__DSH-SessionGraph#feature-3","repo":"lwklbb/DSH-SessionGraph","commit":"cd1f0705be4a5b624374f84339e168905c4f1878","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SessionGraph 的功能「多格式导出」：将导图转换为 Markdown、Mermaid mindmap、PlantUML mindmap、XMind 缩进文本或待办简介。用户在弹窗中选择格式，可查看预览并复制结果到剪贴板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:472-492","lib/client.js:514-522","lib/extractor.js:103-112"]}
{"unit_id":"lwklbb__DSH-SessionGraph#caveat-1","repo":"lwklbb/DSH-SessionGraph","commit":"cd1f0705be4a5b624374f84339e168905c4f1878","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SessionGraph 使用前须知：摘要在浏览器端由当前会话快照生成，源码中的 host 入口为空实现，未显示对持久化会话文件的读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:4-10","lib/client.js:456-459"]}
